WEBVTT

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:26.120
<i>How many of those starry 
fantasies have been forgotten</i>

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>The old dreams no longer shine</i>

00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:37.470
<i>The paths that we have walked 
together are precious treasures</i>

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:43.340
<i>Nothing can hold us back</i>

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>I won't be afraid how long it is tonight</i>

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:54.050
<i>As long as you stand by my side</i>

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Pierce the night sky like 
the first glow of dawn</i>

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.520
<i>And try my best to light the earth</i>

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:03.070
<i>Break through the chains of fate</i>

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.340
<i>No dodge</i>

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.510
<i>No surrender</i>

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.060
<i>On the battlefield your gaze empowers me</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:11.990
<i>No fear to embrace hope</i>

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:17.850
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.930
<i>Bruises are my medals</i>

00:01:29.390 --> 00:01:32.270
<b>Episode Ten
The Last Summoner, Season 1, Part 1</b>

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.560
This is the Demon Furnace!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.620
Rule number one here:

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:43.470
No killing outside the arena!

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.720
I don't care what kind of grudges 
you have against each other.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.390
You can deal with them somewhere else.

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.310
As long as you're on this island,

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:57.560
it doesn't matter if you're the leader of 
a country or the richest man in the world.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:00.970
You have to follow the Demon Furnace's rules!

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:02.500
And you guys!

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.020
Huanxin! Ya! Mengyan!

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:07.870
Yeah, you!

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:10.020
You guys are veterans who 
graduated from this place!

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:13.890
You don't need me to tell 
you what to do, do you?!

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:19.660
Do you have a death wish?!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:22.420
Enough.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:24.980
This is the Demon Furnace.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:28.260
Everyone here has to show Bonnie respect.

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:31.050
We'll call it a day here.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:34.990
What?

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.640
Let's go.

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.810
We'll meet again,

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:42.930
little bunny.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:47.100
Until next time.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:51.930
Good riddance!

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:56.480
What? That's it?

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:58.280
That was close.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.950
Our savior!

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.100
Thank you, dear goddess!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.540
How can we possibly repay you?!

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:07.930
All I can offer is my life!

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:09.810
All right, all right. It's no big deal.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:12.370
So let go, already!

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:19.430
In any case... Welcome to the Demon Furnace.

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:22.790
I'll be waiting at the registration plaza.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.680
I look forward to seeing your 
performance in the arena!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.180
See ya!

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.220
Wait up! We still have lots of questions!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:36.540
Those must be the legendary gale steps!

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.830
How can she run so fast 
on the beach in heels?!

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.100
That's so unscientific!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.900
We lost her.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:57.860
It's hot... I'm tired.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.580
Ah Jie, are you okay?

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.500
This isn't looking good.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:08.160
Hey!

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:10.360
You guys over there.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.300
Need a ride?

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.740
It's an honor to meet you all.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:27.220
I'm a traveling merchant from around here.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:29.510
You can call me Richard.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:40.900
Thank you, kind sir!

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:53.570
Looks like you guys have been through hell.

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:55.440
Did you get shipwrecked or something?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.080
We were being hunted down.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.250
We almost died, in fact!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:02.200
Oh?

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:03.850
You came to the right place, then.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:08.950
Every year, plenty of folks who are wanted
 or on death row come here to hide.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.120
Relax.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.850
It's one hundred percent safe here.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:17.020
Hey, we're a Watchers crew, 
on the side of justice!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.560
It doesn't matter.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:26.760
Here at the Demon Furnace, 
there's no good or bad, only rules.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.270
Care to elaborate?

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:32.490
The legend goes that, long ago,

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:36.120
the Watchers and the Destroyers 
waged an endless war.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:39.420
Their flames of war engulfed the whole 
world and devastated both sides.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.230
To keep the tragedy to a minimum,

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:46.880
the two sides negotiated a ceasefire.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.790
And the great ancient Summoners

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.550
came together and built this 
small island away from the world.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.410
Ever since, battle after battle 
between the two

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:03.770
has been settled peacefully in accordance 
with the rules in the arena here.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.260
And here on Furnace Island,

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:11.100
any kind of fighting or violence 
is strictly forbidden outside of the arena.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:12.730
Simply put,

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.980
the Demon Furnace is like the 
summoning world's Olympics.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:19.820
I see.

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:23.020
No wonder the Destroyers let us go just now.

00:06:23.640 --> 00:06:25.510
How interesting.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.750
I'm curious, though.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:30.770
What happens to those who 
intentionally break the rules?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:32.440
No one dares.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.390
The Demon Furnace is a sacred place.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.380
Anyone who breaks the rules

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:41.030
makes an enemy of the 
Watchers and Destroyers alike.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.200
It doesn't matter how amazing you are.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:46.620
No one can take on all the 
Summoners in the world.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:51.970
Look!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.250
It's so pretty!

00:06:58.950 --> 00:07:00.950
And before you know it, we've arrived.

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:01.680
Take a look.

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:04.420
To the left are the seaport and airport.

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:07.300
Up ahead is Furnace Town.

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:10.710
Through there is the 
Demon Furnace's entrance.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:12.470
Hey!

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:22.680
Come down and get some rest.

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:27.220
This is the best pub in town.

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:28.830
Trust me.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:32.890
The owner's secret drink isn't to be missed.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.560
Newbies again, huh?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:38.500
Bring out the goods.

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.170
The owner's saying hello to us.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.060
I like his spirit.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.140
This is good!

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.580
What a great soda!

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.850
I feel refreshed from the very first gulp!

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.140
Aside from that, 
don't you feel anything else?

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:08.100
My wounds don't hurt so much anymore.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:10.890
You're right. All my 
minor wounds have healed.

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:13.780
I feel like I'm full of energy, too!

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.540
Even my skin feels smoother!

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:15.930
Soft and springy!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:17.540
Not bad, right?

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:21.120
This is the Demon Furnace's top-class 
medicinal underground spring water.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.220
It's quite rare.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.750
So these are the legendary blood vials!

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:26.820
Boss, two more bottles!

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:27.810
Me too!

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.180
<i>Idiots.</i>

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:34.500
<i>It's also addictive, 
but I'm not gonna tell them that.</i>

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.160
All recovered!

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:43.020
I couldn't drink another drop.

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.470
I'm kinda high...

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.700
Boss, check please.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:51.140
After discounts, your total comes 
to 230,000 Furnace Dollars.

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.750
That sounds kinda steep.

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:58.410
Don't worry. This one's on me.

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:00.100
You can pay me back later.

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.890
That's so kind of you.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.870
We're friends, after all.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.130
Let's be on our way.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:22.720
This is Furnace Town.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:27.210
Aside from hotels, there are also 
some restaurants and markets.

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:31.500
It's so lively here!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:33.470
It's also known as the losers' town.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:37.560
<b>Requesting money for a ferry ticket
to leave the Demon Furnace</b>

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:37.560
And that's because only people who 
lost at the Demon Furnace live here.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.310
Are all these people Summoners?

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:43.000
Of course.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:45.040
You can tell by how weird they look.

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.580
Hey! We got fresh Tyrannosaurus meat!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.980
Want to try some?

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.880
All potions are now on clearance.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:54.890
Free bread and water with every sale.

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:58.810
Wow! There's so much more 
here than I imagined!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.560
From warriors' armor to women's underwear,

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:06.040
we have the finest equipment 
one can hope for!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.220
How about it? Come take a look.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.600
That reminds me. Our clothes are in tatters.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.650
They only have low-grade wares here.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:18.220
If you want real equipment, 
try the Demon Furnace's black markets.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:22.310
You should go in and take a look, though.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:36.520
This has gotta be the most exquisite hand-
sewn dark lolita princess outfit I've seen!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.700
Wow! Three catgirl costumes!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.080
Tight bodysuits!

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:41.120
Bandit's cloaks!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.470
Which one should I pick?!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:46.330
A fluorescent enchanted bikini...

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.700
with +30 to sexiness and +10 to affection!

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.700
This is amazing!

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:56.350
Girls in clothing stores are frightening.

00:10:56.910 --> 00:10:58.350
This looks so pretty!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.570
Picked out your outfits?

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.310
I'll get you guys a discount.

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:10.790
Newbies again, huh?

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:12.200
Bring out the goods.

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:14.700
All wrapped up for you!

00:11:14.700 --> 00:11:16.800
And I patched up your old outfits, too!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.700
I already paid for you guys.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:20.930
400,000 is pretty decent.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.100
You're such a nice guy!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:26.770
We're friends, right?

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.700
There are a few good barbecue shops up ahead.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.620
Plus the hot springs, saunas, and hotels.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:33.750
I'll show you guys around.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.370
Yeah!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:37.250
Hey, you idiots.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.000
We didn't come here to sightsee.

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:41.890
Oh, right, almost forgot.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.290
You're an impatient bunch, aren't you?

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.320
Okay.

00:11:47.780 --> 00:11:49.750
Let's head straight to the registration hall.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:05.640
Stay here. Don't go running around.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:11.830
So this is the Demon Furnace.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.860
It's magnificent!

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:36.660
Can you feel it?

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.720
My heart's beating like mad.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.560
This gets my blood boiling!

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:45.620
We finally made it here alive!

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:53.770
Standing above factions and divisions,

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:56.100
good and evil,

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:58.540
life and death,

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.960
and all else!

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:03.830
Everyone!

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.130
Welcome to...

00:13:06.830 --> 00:13:09.240
the Demon Furnace!

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:15.450
There are so many people here...

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:21.680
Hey, there! It's an honor to meet you all 
in the greatest arena on Earth!

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:21.680
My goddess!

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:24.500
I'm the MC for this year's events,

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:25.740
Bonnie!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:28.950
From the South Pole to the North Pole,

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.620
from the Sahara to Alaska,

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:35.300
our contestants come from 
every corner of the world!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:41.220
Here, nationality, race, 
and religion do not divide us.

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:44.460
Nor do we care about age, 
gender, or occupation.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:48.810
Here, all of us share a common name:

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:51.440
Summoners!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:55.770
Summoners! Summoners!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:55.700
Here, we will compete on equal footing.

00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:58.640
Defeat your opponents, 
and advance to the next stage.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.680
You'll either become a legend...

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.470
or die trying!

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.120
Blood and glory!

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.580
Strength and riches!

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:18.180
Okay, today's registration 
ceremony has begun!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:23.060
Now, you just have to walk through 
any one of these four doors,

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:25.220
and you'll be all ready to go!

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.020
I wish all of you good luck!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:30.010
Let's go!

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:42.850
Welcome to Door One.

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:45.200
Your registration fee of two 
million is due in advance.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:48.100
We accept cash, credit, 
and mobile payments.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.810
Isn't that kinda expensive?

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.720
Payment sent. Check your account.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.120
Payment received. Go right in.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.740
Where did you get all that money?

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.020
Did you rob a bank again?

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:10.100
I just hacked a couple of Mexican 
cartel bosses' bank accounts.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.350
I'll wait for you guys inside!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:17.330
Hey, if you ain't got the money, 
line up at another door!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:18.680
You're in the way!

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:22.220
I'm paying in cash.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.310
Let's head to Door Two.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:33.220
Perfect!

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:33.850
Perfect!

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:34.640
Perfect!

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:36.380
Simply perfect!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:38.970
You pass! You pass!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.310
Hey, is this a beauty contest?!

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:44.910
That's right!

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:47.930
Door Two's eligibility standard is beauty!

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:49.680
Should've said so sooner!

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:54.380
Smooch!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.000
You pass!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.150
Master,

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:01.140
let's go.

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:18.560
Why?!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.770
I'll be honest: you don't 
have the looks, or the figure.

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:27.760
Have some self-awareness, and go line up 
at Door Three, the strength test.

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:38.100
Eight hundred kilograms of force. You pass.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:41.250
That's nothing!

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:56.830
Damn them! How dare they 
look down on a tomboy!

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.030
You pass...

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.990
Looks like all of you passed.

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:09.130
Sir!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:12.790
You went to Door Four?

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:13.930
What did they test there?

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.460
Reputation.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:21.940
Door Four is an express lane for movie stars, 
politicians, bureaucrats, and aristocrats.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.000
Hey, isn't that guy...

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.600
I thought he died!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:35.290
Lots of famous folk fake their deaths 
so they can join the trials

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:37.470
with their minds at ease.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:40.290
Are you famous, Richard?

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.720
I guess I am.

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.050
<i>After all, I'm an infamous criminal.</i>

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.850
<i>One of the ten most wanted 
in the world, even.</i>

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:53.540
Money, beauty, strength, and reputation.

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:56.220
I never knew the Demon Furnace 
was such a vulgar place.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.620
The real world is a cruel one.

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.370
That said...

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:04.020
As a Summoner,

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:06.210
if you don't have one 
of those four qualities,

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:09.150
what right do you have to 
participate in these trials?

00:18:18.750 --> 00:18:20.770
Okay, everybody.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:24.040
Those of you who've made it through 
the registrations, come on over.

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.020
We'll be heading to the first 
stop of our journey soon.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:40.350
What you see here is the Demon Furnace Arena.

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:42.430
It has one hundred floors.

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:46.600
Floors one to twenty are our meticulously 
prepared competition arenas!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.570
What a deep hole!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.870
Our competitions are like 
a stairway to heaven.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.350
It gets harder the further down you go.

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:02.140
At the same time, the rewards 
also get much, much better!

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.540
I really have to say, though.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.180
Isn't this just a huge sinkhole?

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:10.790
It's a hole, all right.

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:15.750
I've tried it many times. 
The furthest I got was the fifth floor.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.410
That's not bad. I only made it to the third.

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:20.600
You guys are repeat challengers, too?

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.440
Pleasure to meet you.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.960
This is my fifth year trying. 
I'm still at the first checkpoint.

00:19:30.410 --> 00:19:32.990
On my best run, I got to the ninth floor.

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:40.100
I'm gonna blast through these floors 
and go straight to the hundredth!

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:46.930
In your dreams.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:51.000
They say that not even 1 in 1,000 challengers 
makes it to the tenth floor in one try.

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:54.000
So what? We're gonna do it!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:57.390
Dad...

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.320
On which of these floors will I see you?

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.580
Ta-dah!

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:20.720
Right now, we're at the 
first floor checkpoint.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.850
Here at the Demon Furnace, 
there's one checkpoint every ten floors.

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:31.160
Be careful of your progress.

00:20:31.160 --> 00:20:34.140
If you mess up, you'll have to start 
over from the last checkpoint.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:47.390
On the first floor of the Furnace 
is a luxury hotel for our contestants.

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:50.820
It's completely free, 
so be sure to enjoy your stay.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:55.770
How is it? Thoughtful, huh?

00:20:56.790 --> 00:21:00.220
This tournament's first elimination 
round will begin tomorrow.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.100
Good luck to all of you.

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:08.450
Well then, I'll see you guys again tomorrow.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.840
See ya!

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:19.600
The restaurant's this way!

00:21:19.600 --> 00:21:22.020
I can smell the roast pork 
and lobster noodles!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:23.500
Run!

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:26.250
Let's go!

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:31.740
Only newbies eat the Furnace Hotel's food.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:38.030
They don't even know that 
the trials have already begun.

00:21:49.930 --> 00:21:56.420
<i>Sit with you watching the night sky</i>

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:01.660
<i>Vast stars reflect in our eyes</i>

00:22:02.190 --> 00:22:09.250
<i>Like thousands of tiny wishes in our hearts</i>

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:14.770
<i>Longing to discover the origin of the 
mysterious everlasting ancient world</i>

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:19.760
<i>The past and the present are 
linked in a fantastic instant</i>

00:22:19.760 --> 00:22:24.760
<i>Watch over our beautiful 
home against evil forever</i>

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:29.750
<i>The blazing sun is our inevitable 
cruel test of growth</i>

00:22:29.750 --> 00:22:34.800
<i>May we return from thorny 
paths still being young</i>

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:39.800
<i>With love and hate, laughter and 
tears, compose every touching moment</i>

00:22:39.800 --> 00:22:44.760
<i>Five friends shoulder to shoulder, 
friendship will last until eternity</i>

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:52.210
<i>With you tomorrow must 
be full of shining hopes</i>

00:22:52.210 --> 00:22:57.360
<i>Our tomorrow</i>
